   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Rule 1 · Count the carbons (stem)",
   "narration": "Find the **longest chain** of carbons and count it: **7 carbons**, so the stem is [[stem|hept]]. (Mice Eat Peanut Butter: 1–4; then pent 5, hex 6, hept 7.)",
